00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.330
And Calvin Tenner is Hiday and Glenn.

198
00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:44.250
I'm sorry.

199
00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:45.830
Is this, oh, hello, or is it hi there?

200
00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:48.370
Because, oh, you pivoted.

201
00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:49.330
It's all.

202
00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:50.930
It's, oh, hello.

203
00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:51.830
Hi there.

204
00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:52.450
Hi there.

205
00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:54.130
Oh, good to see you again.

206
00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:55.390
Top of the morning to you.

207
00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.070
That's right.

208
00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:00.810
Good to see you again, Mike Schur as Moe's, who we haven't seen in a real long time.

209
00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:01.510
Yes.

210
00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.070
Mm-hmm.

211
00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:03.410
Oh, is that section done?

212
00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:04.350
That section's done.

213
00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:04.590
Okay.

214
00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.230
Oh, hello, hi there is done.

215
00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:06.830
Yes.

216
00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:08.050
And the goodbyes are done.

217
00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:08.310
Okay.

218
00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.630
In fact, I'm moving on to Fast Fact number two.

219
00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:11.990
Oh, let's do it.

220
00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.430
I'm calling Fast Fact number two, Reflections.

221
00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.750
Oh, gosh.

222
00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.650
And you did like the whisper voice.

223
00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:19.530
Reflections.

224
00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.250
Reflections with office ladies.

