228
00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:34.990
I thought that question might kick off our Reflections.

229
00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:37.710
Well, it's a fantastic question from Allison.

230
00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:39.230
What's up, Big D?

231
00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.250
Love, Dallas.

232
00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:42.550
Just thought I would just say that.

233
00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:43.410
Shout out, Dallas.

234
00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:44.490
Shout out, Dallas.

235
00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:48.110
Gosh, Jenna, that's one of those thinking questions.

236
00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:49.810
I gave it some thought.

237
00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:50.830
I sent it to you.

238
00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.370
We thought on it, Allison.

239
00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.470
We thought on it.

240
00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:54.130
We sure did.

241
00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:58.070
It has been a really wild ride watching this show again.

242
00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.530
I've just loved it.

243
00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:03.550
I've really gained a deeper appreciation as a fan.

244
00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:03.990
Yeah.

245
00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:08.050
And I have to say, there are so many episodes that surprised me,

246
00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:10.370
