Well, that's my lawyer look.

262
00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:49.750
That's when you know I'm serious.

263
00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:50.170
Okay.

264
00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:50.730
Serious.

265
00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:54.790
I thought season eight was a little clunky.

266
00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:03.750
I know that we were trying to find our way after Steve left, and I think you can tell.

267
00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:10.530
Well, you're doing that thing where you say something you don't think is 100% going to be received well,

268
00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:11.410
