00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:48.750
You know, like you said, I have this new appreciation for the show in a way that I didn't when we were filming it, even though I was a big fan of the show when we filmed it.

309
00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:53.090
But now I have an appreciation of the fandom of the show.

